
<!DOCTYPE html>
<html lang="zh-CN">
<head>
  <meta charset="UTF-8" />
  <meta name="viewport" content="width=device-width, initial-scale=1.0" />
  <title>《西游记》神仙体系全景图</title>
  <script src="https://cdn.tailwindcss.com"></script>
  <script src="https://cdn.jsdelivr.net/npm/echarts@5/dist/echarts.min.js"></script>
  <script>
    tailwind.config = {
      theme: {
        extend: {
          colors: {
            vermilion: '#C41E3A',
            imperial: '#FFD700',
            azurite: '#1A5276',
            ink: '#1C1C1C',
            ivory: '#FFFFF0',
            pine: '#2E8B57',
            rice: '#F5F5DC'
          }
        }
      }
    };
  </script>
  <style>
    :root {
      --vermilion: #C41E3A;
      --imperial: #FFD700;
      --azurite: #1A5276;
      --ink: #1C1C1C;
      --ivory: #FFFFF0;
      --pine: #2E8B57;
      --rice: #F5F5DC;
      --gold: rgba(180, 139, 42, .64);
      --hero-image: url("data:image/png;base64,");
    }
    html { scroll-behavior: smooth; }
    body {
      margin: 0;
      color: var(--ink);
      font-family: "宋体", SimSun, serif;
      background:
        radial-gradient(circle at 18% 10%, rgba(255, 215, 0, .12), transparent 22rem),
        radial-gradient(circle at 88% 18%, rgba(196, 30, 58, .08), transparent 20rem),
        linear-gradient(135deg, rgba(255,255,240,.86), rgba(245,245,220,.96)),
        var(--rice);
    }
    body::before {
      content: "";
      position: fixed;
      inset: 0;
      z-index: -1;
      pointer-events: none;
      background-image:
        radial-gradient(ellipse at center, transparent 58%, rgba(26,82,118,.04) 59%, transparent 62%),
        radial-gradient(ellipse at center, transparent 56%, rgba(196,30,58,.035) 57%, transparent 60%);
      background-size: 180px 90px, 230px 115px;
      opacity: .75;
    }
    h1, h2, h3, .title-font { font-family: "楷体_GB2312", KaiTi, "STKaiti", serif; }
    .latin { font-family: Georgia, "Times New Roman", serif; }
    .nav-glass {
      background: rgba(255,255,240,.92);
      border-bottom: 1px solid rgba(180,139,42,.28);
      backdrop-filter: blur(16px);
    }
    .gold-card {
      border: 1px solid rgba(180,139,42,.42);
      background: rgba(255,255,240,.86);
      border-radius: 8px;
      box-shadow: 0 14px 32px rgba(28,28,28,.08);
    }
    .hero {
      min-height: min(720px, 88vh);
      position: relative;
      overflow: hidden;
      background:
        linear-gradient(180deg, rgba(255,255,240,.9), rgba(245,245,220,.72)),
        radial-gradient(circle at 50% 24%, rgba(255,215,0,.24), transparent 15rem),
        linear-gradient(110deg, rgba(26,82,118,.18), transparent 42%),
        var(--hero-image),
        var(--rice);
      background-size: auto, auto, auto, cover, auto;
      background-position: center;
    }
    .hero::after {
      content: "";
      position: absolute;
      left: 0;
      right: 0;
      bottom: 0;
      height: 46%;
      opacity: .42;
      background:
        linear-gradient(150deg, transparent 0 35%, rgba(28,28,28,.24) 35.2% 36%, transparent 36.2%),
        linear-gradient(30deg, transparent 0 39%, rgba(28,28,28,.2) 39.2% 40%, transparent 40.2%),
        linear-gradient(0deg, transparent 0 50%, rgba(28,28,28,.23) 50.2% 51%, transparent 51.2%),
        radial-gradient(ellipse at 50% 95%, rgba(28,28,28,.18), transparent 42%);
      mask-image: linear-gradient(to top, #000, transparent 94%);
    }
    .arrow { animation: floatArrow 1.7s ease-in-out infinite; }
    @keyframes floatArrow {
      0%, 100% { transform: translateY(0); opacity: .58; }
      50% { transform: translateY(10px); opacity: 1; }
    }
    .faction-btn, .tab-btn {
      border: 1px solid rgba(180,139,42,.34);
      background: var(--ivory);
      border-radius: 8px;
      transition: background-color .18s ease, color .18s ease, box-shadow .18s ease;
    }
    .faction-btn.active, .tab-btn.active {
      background: var(--vermilion);
      color: var(--ivory);
      box-shadow: 0 8px 20px rgba(196,30,58,.18);
    }
    .hierarchy-shell {
      height: min(780px, 78vh);
      overflow: hidden;
      cursor: grab;
      touch-action: none;
      background:
        linear-gradient(rgba(255,255,240,.9), rgba(255,255,240,.9)),
        repeating-linear-gradient(90deg, transparent 0 42px, rgba(180,139,42,.045) 42px 43px),
        repeating-linear-gradient(0deg, transparent 0 42px, rgba(26,82,118,.035) 42px 43px);
    }
    .hierarchy-shell.dragging { cursor: grabbing; }
    .hierarchy-inner {
      position: relative;
      width: 1240px;
      min-height: 1080px;
      padding: 28px;
      transform-origin: 0 0;
    }
    .layer-band {
      position: relative;
      min-height: 148px;
      margin-bottom: 18px;
      padding: 20px;
      border: 1px solid rgba(180,139,42,.34);
      border-radius: 8px;
      background: rgba(255,255,240,.76);
    }
    .layer-name {
      writing-mode: vertical-rl;
      text-orientation: mixed;
      min-width: 42px;
    }
    .deity-card {
      --size: 88px;
      width: var(--size);
      min-width: var(--size);
      height: var(--size);
      border-radius: 999px;
      border: 2px solid var(--ring);
      background:
        radial-gradient(circle at 50% 34%, rgba(255,255,240,.98), rgba(255,250,220,.94) 48%, rgba(255,215,0,.22)),
        var(--ivory);
      box-shadow: 0 10px 20px rgba(28,28,28,.12), inset 0 0 0 6px rgba(255,255,240,.72);
      transition: transform .16s ease, box-shadow .16s ease, opacity .16s ease;
    }
    .deity-card:hover, .deity-card.highlight {
      transform: scale(1.08);
      z-index: 5;
      box-shadow: 0 18px 28px rgba(28,28,28,.18), 0 0 0 5px rgba(255,215,0,.22);
    }
    .deity-card.dimmed { opacity: .25; filter: grayscale(.45); }
    .deity-mark {
      width: calc(var(--size) * .44);
      height: calc(var(--size) * .44);
      border-radius: 999px;
      display: grid;
      place-items: center;
      border: 1px solid rgba(180,139,42,.48);
      color: var(--ring);
      background: rgba(255,255,240,.82);
      font-family: "楷体_GB2312", KaiTi, serif;
      font-size: calc(var(--size) * .21);
    }
    .connector-svg {
      position: absolute;
      inset: 0;
      pointer-events: none;
      z-index: 0;
      overflow: visible;
    }
    .detail-panel {
      transform: translateX(100%);
      transition: transform .22s ease;
    }
    .detail-panel.open { transform: translateX(0); }
    .chart-box { height: 370px; }
    .small-chart { height: 320px; }
    .divider {
      display: flex;
      align-items: center;
      gap: 12px;
      color: rgba(180,139,42,.9);
    }
    .divider::before, .divider::after {
      content: "";
      height: 1px;
      flex: 1;
      background: linear-gradient(90deg, transparent, rgba(180,139,42,.72), transparent);
    }
    .image-tile {
      min-height: 210px;
      overflow: hidden;
      border: 1px solid rgba(180,139,42,.38);
      border-radius: 8px;
      background: rgba(255,255,240,.86);
      box-shadow: 0 12px 28px rgba(28,28,28,.08);
    }
    .image-tile img {
      width: 100%;
      height: 180px;
      object-fit: cover;
      display: block;
    }
    @media (max-width: 768px) {
      .hero { min-height: 620px; }
      .hierarchy-shell { height: 680px; }
      .hierarchy-inner { width: 980px; }
      .chart-box, .small-chart { height: 300px; }
    }
    @media (max-width: 1023px) {
      #navLinks { display: none; }
      #navLinks.menu-open { display: flex; }
    }
    @media print {
      nav, .no-print, #detailPanel, #shareModal { display: none !important; }
      body { background: #fffdf0; }
      section { break-inside: avoid; page-break-inside: avoid; }
      .hierarchy-shell { height: auto; overflow: visible !important; }
      .hierarchy-inner { transform: none !important; }
    }
  </style>
</head>
<body>
  <nav class="nav-glass fixed top-0 z-40 w-full">
    <div class="mx-auto flex max-w-7xl flex-col gap-3 px-4 py-3 lg:flex-row lg:items-center lg:justify-between">
      <div class="flex items-center justify-between gap-4">
        <a href="#top" class="title-font text-xl font-bold text-vermilion sm:text-2xl">《西游记》神仙体系全景图</a>
        <button id="mobileMenuBtn" class="no-print rounded border border-yellow-700/30 px-3 py-2 text-sm text-azurite lg:hidden">菜单</button>
      </div>
      <div id="navLinks" class="hidden flex-col gap-2 text-sm text-ink lg:flex lg:flex-row lg:items-center lg:gap-5">
        <a href="#overview" class="hover:text-vermilion">体系总览</a>
        <a href="#factions" class="hover:text-vermilion">阵营详解</a>
        <a href="#relations" class="hover:text-vermilion">关系图谱</a>
        <a href="#stats" class="hover:text-vermilion">数据统计</a>
        <a href="#about" class="hover:text-vermilion">关于本项目</a>
      </div>
      <div class="no-print flex flex-col gap-2 lg:min-w-[520px]">
        <div class="flex gap-2">
          <input id="searchInput" type="search" placeholder="搜索神仙名称，如：如来、玉帝、哪吒" class="w-full rounded border border-yellow-700/30 bg-ivory px-3 py-2 text-sm outline-none focus:border-vermilion" />
          <button id="printBtn" class="rounded border border-yellow-700/40 bg-ivory px-3 py-2 text-sm text-azurite">打印</button>
          <button id="shareBtn" class="rounded border border-yellow-700/40 bg-ivory px-3 py-2 text-sm text-vermilion">分享</button>
        </div>
        <div id="factionFilters" class="flex flex-wrap gap-2"></div>
      </div>
    </div>
  </nav>

  <header id="top" class="hero flex items-center pt-28">
    <div class="relative z-10 mx-auto w-full max-w-7xl px-4 py-20">
      <div class="max-w-3xl">
        <div class="divider mb-8 max-w-sm text-sm">儒释道合流的文学宇宙</div>
        <h1 class="title-font text-5xl font-bold leading-tight text-ink sm:text-7xl"><span class="block sm:inline">三界五行，</span><span class="block sm:inline">六道轮回</span></h1>
        <p class="mt-6 max-w-2xl text-xl leading-9 text-azurite sm:text-2xl">《西游记》神仙体系的权力结构与文化内涵</p>
        <p class="mt-8 max-w-2xl text-base leading-8 text-ink/75">以平面分层方式梳理灵山、天庭、人间、龙宫、地府与游离势力，呈现小说中神圣秩序、行政权力、修行谱系与民间想象的交织。</p>
      </div>
      <a href="#overview" class="arrow absolute bottom-8 left-1/2 grid h-12 w-12 -translate-x-1/2 place-items-center rounded-full border border-yellow-700/40 bg-ivory/80 text-2xl text-vermilion shadow-sm">⌄</a>
    </div>
  </header>

  <main>
    <section id="overview" class="mx-auto max-w-7xl px-4 py-16">
      <div class="mb-8 flex flex-col gap-4 lg:flex-row lg:items-end lg:justify-between">
        <div>
          <p class="latin text-sm uppercase text-pine">Hierarchy Overview</p>
          <h2 class="title-font mt-2 text-4xl font-bold">分层神仙体系总览</h2>
          <p class="mt-3 max-w-3xl leading-8 text-ink/72">圆形卡片大小代表叙事与体系地位。金色细线表示小说中明确统辖、师承、降伏、求援或亲属关系；传统宗教谱系仅作为文化位置辅助理解。</p>
        </div>
        <div class="no-print flex flex-wrap gap-2 text-sm">
          <select id="layerSelect" class="rounded border border-yellow-700/30 bg-ivory px-3 py-2"></select>
          <button id="resetViewBtn" class="rounded border border-yellow-700/40 bg-ivory px-3 py-2 text-azurite">重置视图</button>
        </div>
      </div>
      <div class="mb-8 grid gap-4 md:grid-cols-3">
        <figure class="image-tile">
          <img id="palaceImage" src="data:image/png;base64," alt="水墨天宫与祥云意象图" />
          <figcaption class="px-4 py-3 text-sm leading-6 text-ink/70">天宫秩序：以层叠屋脊和云气表现天庭的官僚结构。</figcaption>
        </figure>
        <figure class="image-tile">
          <img id="journeyImage" src="data:image/png;base64," alt="取经队伍剪影意象图" />
          <figcaption class="px-4 py-3 text-sm leading-6 text-ink/70">取经路径：用剪影化人物表现由人间通向灵山的修行线索。</figcaption>
        </figure>
        <figure class="image-tile">
          <img id="mandalaImage" src="data:image/png;base64," alt="儒释道三教合一关系意象图" />
          <figcaption class="px-4 py-3 text-sm leading-6 text-ink/70">三教合流：朱红、石青、松绿三色对应佛教、天庭与道教谱系。</figcaption>
        </figure>
      </div>
      <div class="gold-card overflow-hidden">
        <div class="flex flex-wrap justify-between gap-3 border-b border-yellow-700/20 px-4 py-3 text-sm text-ink/70">
          <span>操作：滚轮缩放，按住空白处拖拽平移，点击人物查看详情。</span>
          <span id="resultCount" class="latin text-vermilion"></span>
        </div>
        <div id="hierarchyShell" class="hierarchy-shell relative">
          <div id="hierarchyInner" class="hierarchy-inner">
            <svg id="connectorSvg" class="connector-svg"></svg>
            <div id="hierarchyContent" class="relative z-[1]"></div>
          </div>
        </div>
      </div>
    </section>

    <section id="factions" class="bg-ivory/65 py-16">
      <div class="mx-auto max-w-7xl px-4">
        <p class="latin text-sm uppercase text-pine">Faction Studies</p>
        <h2 class="title-font mt-2 text-4xl font-bold">阵营详解</h2>
        <div id="factionTabs" class="no-print my-6 flex flex-wrap gap-2"></div>
        <div class="grid gap-6 lg:grid-cols-[1.05fr_1.25fr]">
          <article class="gold-card p-6">
            <h3 id="factionTitle" class="title-font text-3xl font-bold text-vermilion"></h3>
            <p id="factionIntro" class="mt-4 leading-8 text-ink/75"></p>
            <h4 class="title-font mt-6 text-xl font-semibold text-azurite">核心人物</h4>
            <div id="corePeople" class="mt-4 grid gap-3 sm:grid-cols-2"></div>
            <h4 class="title-font mt-6 text-xl font-semibold text-azurite">主要事迹</h4>
            <ul id="factionEvents" class="mt-3 space-y-2 leading-7 text-ink/75"></ul>
          </article>
          <div class="gold-card p-4"><div id="factionTree" class="chart-box"></div></div>
        </div>
      </div>
    </section>

    <section id="relations" class="mx-auto max-w-7xl px-4 py-16">
      <div class="mb-8 flex flex-col gap-4 lg:flex-row lg:items-end lg:justify-between">
        <div>
          <p class="latin text-sm uppercase text-pine">Interactive Network</p>
          <h2 class="title-font mt-2 text-4xl font-bold">交互式关系图谱</h2>
          <p class="mt-3 max-w-3xl leading-8 text-ink/72">拖拽节点可重新排布关系网络，节点大小对应人物重要性，连线标签标注关系类型。</p>
        </div>
        <button id="graphResetBtn" class="no-print rounded border border-yellow-700/40 bg-ivory px-3 py-2 text-sm text-azurite">重绘图谱</button>
      </div>
      <div class="gold-card p-4"><div id="relationGraph" class="chart-box"></div></div>
    </section>

    <section id="stats" class="bg-ivory/65 py-16">
      <div class="mx-auto max-w-7xl px-4">
        <p class="latin text-sm uppercase text-pine">Data Statistics</p>
        <h2 class="title-font mt-2 text-4xl font-bold">数据统计</h2>
        <div class="mt-8 grid gap-6 lg:grid-cols-2">
          <div class="gold-card p-4"><div id="pieChart" class="small-chart"></div></div>
          <div class="gold-card p-4"><div id="layerChart" class="small-chart"></div></div>
          <div class="gold-card p-4"><div id="originChart" class="small-chart"></div></div>
          <div class="gold-card p-4"><div id="appearChart" class="small-chart"></div></div>
        </div>
      </div>
    </section>

    <section id="about" class="mx-auto max-w-7xl px-4 py-16">
      <div class="grid gap-6 lg:grid-cols-[.9fr_1.1fr]">
        <article class="gold-card p-6">
          <p class="latin text-sm uppercase text-pine">About</p>
          <h2 class="title-font mt-2 text-4xl font-bold">关于本项目</h2>
          <dl class="mt-6 space-y-4 leading-8">
            <div><dt class="title-font text-xl text-vermilion">课程信息</dt><dd>“西游记与中国文化”通识课作业</dd></div>
            <div><dt class="title-font text-xl text-vermilion">作者信息</dt><dd class="rounded border border-yellow-700/40 bg-white/45 px-3 py-2 text-ink/75">马瑞霖</dd></div>
            <div><dt class="title-font text-xl text-vermilion">创作思路</dt><dd>本项目以原著回目、人物出场、权力归属与文化象征为线索，将小说中的神圣秩序转译为可交互的平面图谱，并区分小说明示关系与文化解释框架。</dd></div>
            <div><dt class="title-font text-xl text-vermilion">参考文献</dt><dd>吴承恩著：《西游记》（世德堂本系统）。鲁迅：《中国小说史略》。余国藩：《余国藩西游记论集》。李安纲：《西游记文化学》。相关佛教、道教神谱与明代小说研究论文。</dd></div>
          </dl>
        </article>
        <article class="gold-card p-6">
          <h3 class="title-font text-3xl font-bold text-azurite">展示说明与提交方式</h3>
          <div class="mt-4 space-y-6 leading-8 text-ink/75">
            <div>
              <h4 class="title-font text-xl font-semibold text-vermilion">研究方法</h4>
              <p>页面以“人物出场回目、阵营归属、权力层级、关系类型、文化象征”五个维度组织材料。分层总览用于把握三界结构，关系图谱用于观察人物之间的师徒、亲属、统属、降伏与求援关系，统计图表用于辅助课堂汇报。</p>
            </div>
            <div>
              <h4 class="title-font text-xl font-semibold text-vermilion">展示亮点</h4>
              <ul class="list-disc space-y-2 pl-6">
                <li>用平面分层图呈现灵山、天庭、人间与龙宫、地府、游离层。</li>
                <li>用 ECharts 力导向图展示人物关系，点击节点可查看详情。</li>
                <li>用阵营标签页和统计图辅助说明儒释道三教合一的文化结构。</li>
                <li>内置搜索、筛选、详情面板、分享和打印功能，适合课堂演示。</li>
              </ul>
            </div>
            <div>
              <h4 class="title-font text-xl font-semibold text-vermilion">后续优化建议</h4>
              <ul class="list-disc space-y-2 pl-6">
                <li>扩展人物数据到一百位以上，并为每条关系补充具体回目证据。</li>
                <li>为原著引用增加页码或校勘版本说明，提升学术可信度。</li>
                <li>增加导出长图功能，便于课程展示与打印海报。</li>
                <li>加入时间线视图，展示取经途中神仙出场顺序。</li>
                <li>补充“原著关系”和“后世宗教体系”两个开关，区分文本事实与文化解释。</li>
              </ul>
            </div>
          </div>
        </article>
      </div>
    </section>
  </main>

  <footer class="border-t border-yellow-700/20 bg-ink px-4 py-8 text-ivory">
    <div class="mx-auto flex max-w-7xl flex-col gap-4 sm:flex-row sm:items-center sm:justify-between">
      <p>© 2026 《西游记》神仙体系全景图。课程作业展示用途。</p>
      <a href="#top" class="no-print rounded border border-yellow-300/40 px-4 py-2 text-sm text-yellow-100 hover:bg-white/10">回到顶部</a>
    </div>
  </footer>

  <aside id="detailPanel" class="detail-panel fixed right-0 top-0 z-50 h-full w-full max-w-md overflow-y-auto border-l border-yellow-700/30 bg-ivory p-6 shadow-2xl">
    <button id="closeDetailBtn" class="no-print mb-5 rounded border border-yellow-700/40 px-3 py-2 text-sm text-azurite">关闭</button>
    <div id="detailContent"></div>
  </aside>

  <div id="shareModal" class="no-print fixed inset-0 z-[60] hidden bg-ink/45 p-4">
    <div class="mx-auto mt-28 max-w-md rounded-lg border border-yellow-700/30 bg-ivory p-6 shadow-2xl">
      <h3 class="title-font text-2xl font-bold text-vermilion">分享本项目</h3>
      <p class="mt-3 leading-7 text-ink/75">部署上线后，可复制网页地址分享到微信；微博按钮会打开预填分享窗口。</p>
      <input id="shareUrlInput" class="mt-4 w-full rounded border border-yellow-700/30 bg-white px-3 py-2 text-sm" readonly />
